Excuse me.

556
00:29:46,871 --> 00:29:49,785
Listening Test

557
00:29:49,785 --> 00:29:53,151
No, stamp pad seals aren't accepted.

558
00:29:53,151 --> 00:29:57,818
N + は だめです = (N) is not allowed

559
00:29:57,841 --> 00:30:00,035
Listening Test

560
00:30:00,035 --> 00:30:02,507
I see.

561
00:30:05,998 --> 00:30:08,898
Listening Test

562
