So, a regular personal seal, then.

563
00:30:12,236 --> 00:30:16,870
普通(ふつう)の + N = A regular (N) (e.g., a regular seal)

564
00:30:16,893 --> 00:30:18,793
Yes, I do.

565
00:30:18,816 --> 00:30:23,116
Listening Test

566
00:30:23,116 --> 00:30:28,216
You'll also need your My Number Card.

567
00:30:28,216 --> 00:30:35,167
あとは = Besides that, (e.g., Besides that, do you have your Individual Number Card?)

568
00:30:35,190 --> 00:30:38,257
Listening Test

569
00:30:38,257 --> 00:30:41,811
My Number Card, right.

570
00:30:41,811 --> 00:30:46,711
N + ですね = (N), right?

571
00:30:46,734 --> 00:30:48,640
Yes, I do.

572
00:30:48,663 --> 00:30:51,130
Listening Test

573
00:30:51,130 --> 00:30:53,913
Do you have it with you?

574
00:30:53,913 --> 00:30:57,779
Vていますか = Do you have...?

575
00:30:57,802 --> 00:30:59,746
Yes, I do.

576
00:30:59,770 --> 00:31:01,684
Listening Test

577
00:31:01,684 --> 00:31:03,820
Yes, I have it.

578
00:31:03,820 --> 00:31:06,853
Vています = I/You have (e.g., I have it)

579
00:31:06,876 --> 00:31:09,620
Listening Test

580
00:31:09,620 --> 00:31:12,776
Yes, that's fine.

581
00:31:12,776 --> 00:31:17,153
それなら = In that case...

582
00:31:17,176 --> 00:31:20,164
Listening Test

583
00:31:20,164 --> 00:31:23,637
Do I need my passport too?

584
00:31:23,637 --> 00:31:28,426
N + も 必要(ひつよう)ですか = Do you also need (N)? (e.g., Do you also need your passport?)

585
00:31:28,449 --> 00:31:32,225
Listening Test

586
00:31:32,225 --> 00:31:36,692
No, you don't need your passport.

587
00:31:36,692 --> 00:31:42,792
N + は 要(い)りません = You don’t need (N)

588
00:31:42,815 --> 00:31:45,329
Listening Test

589
00:31:45,329 --> 00:31:48,195
Got it.

590
00:31:52,194 --> 00:31:56,227
Listening Test

591
00:31:56,227 --> 00:32:00,994
You'll also need to deposit a small amount of money upfront.

592
00:32:00,994 --> 00:32:07,496
V + N = (N) that you (V) (e.g., The first document)

593
00:32:07,520 --> 00:32:09,502
Listening Test

594
00:32:09,502 --> 00:32:11,735
How much?

595
00:32:11,735 --> 00:32:14,845
いくらですか = How much is it?

596
00:32:14,868 --> 00:32:18,168
Listening Test

597
00:32:18,168 --> 00:32:22,001
Around 1,000 yen will do.

598
00:32:22,001 --> 00:32:27,271
N + くらいでいいです = About (N) is fine (e.g., About this much is fine)

599
00:32:27,295 --> 00:32:29,439
Listening Test

600
00:32:29,439 --> 00:32:31,872
Got it.

601
00:32:35,276 --> 00:32:38,612
Listening Test

602
00:32:38,612 --> 00:32:42,528
The process will take some time.

603
00:32:42,528 --> 00:32:47,896
時間(じかん)がかかります = It takes time

604
00:32:47,919 --> 00:32:50,753
Listening Test

605
00:32:50,753 --> 00:32:53,986
How long will it take?

606
00:32:53,986 --> 00:32:58,486
どのくらい かかりますか = How long will it take?

607
00:32:58,509 --> 00:33:01,497
Listening Test

608
00:33:01,497 --> 00:33:04,964
About an hour.

609
00:33:04,964 --> 00:33:09,735
N + くらい かかります = It takes about (N) (e.g., It takes about one hour)

610
00:33:09,758 --> 00:33:12,025
Listening Test

611
00:33:12,025 --> 00:33:14,558
Got it.

612
00:33:18,124 --> 00:33:20,757
Listening Test

613
00:33:20,757 --> 00:33:23,748
I'll come back tomorrow.

614
00:33:23,748 --> 00:33:27,915
また + Vます = (V) again (e.g., See you tomorrow)

615
00:33:27,938 --> 00:33:30,371
Listening Test

616
00:33:30,371 --> 00:33:33,123
We look forward to seeing you then.

617
00:33:33,123 --> 00:33:36,956
お待(ま)ちしております = I/We look forward to seeing you

618
00:33:36,979 --> 00:33:39,646
Listening Test

619
00:33:39,646 --> 00:33:42,679
Thank you.

620
00:33:46,936 --> 00:33:48,436
Scene 3: Teaching How to Fill Out Forms / How to Fill Out Forms in Japanese

621
00:33:48,436 --> 00:33:51,502
Listening Test

622
00:33:51,502 --> 00:33:55,050
Thank you for waiting.

623
00:33:55,050 --> 00:33:59,953
お待(ま)たせする = To keep you waiting

624
00:33:59,977 --> 00:34:05,310
Listening Test

625
00:34:05,310 --> 00:34:11,699
Excuse me, could you show me how to fill out this form?

626
00:34:11,699 --> 00:34:20,399
Vstem + 方(かた) = How to (V) (e.g., How to fill out the form)

627
00:34:20,422 --> 00:34:24,588
Listening Test

628
00:34:24,588 --> 00:34:29,525
Of course, what part don't you understand?

629
00:34:29,525 --> 00:34:36,268
どこ + が + V = Where/Which part (do you mean)?

630
00:34:36,292 --> 00:34:39,525
Listening Test

631
00:34:39,525 --> 00:34:43,259
Right here, the name section.

632
00:34:43,259 --> 00:34:48,399
N + です = It is (N) (e.g., It’s my name)

633
00:34:48,422 --> 00:34:51,300
Listening Test

634
00:34:51,300 --> 00:34:54,634
Your name, yes.

635
00:34:54,634 --> 00:34:59,267
N + ですね = It’s (N), right?

636
00:34:59,290 --> 00:35:02,274
Listening Test

637
00:35:02,274 --> 00:35:05,753
Should I write it in kanji?

638
00:35:05,753 --> 00:35:10,522
N + で = In/With (N) (e.g., in kanji)

639
00:35:10,546 --> 00:35:13,313
Listening Test

640
00:35:13,313 --> 00:35:16,491
Or in romaji?

641
00:35:16,491 --> 00:35:20,886
N + で = In/With (N) (e.g., in romaji)

642
00:35:20,909 --> 00:35:25,409
Listening Test

643
00:35:25,409 --> 00:35:30,744
Please write it the same way as on your residence card.

644
00:35:30,744 --> 00:35:38,024
N + と + 同じように = in the same way as N
Residence Card = residence card
Same (同じ) ↔ Different (違う)

645
00:35:38,047 --> 00:35:40,681
Listening Test

646
00:35:40,681 --> 00:35:43,661
In romaji, then.

647
00:35:43,661 --> 00:35:47,809
N + ですね = It’s (N), right?

648
00:35:47,832 --> 00:35:50,204
Listening Test

649
00:35:50,204 --> 00:35:52,904
Got it.

650
00:35:56,697 --> 00:36:00,891
Listening Test

651
00:36:00,891 --> 00:36:05,864
And please write your furigana in the space above.

652
00:36:05,864 --> 00:36:12,697
Vて + ください = please do...
Top/Above (上) ↔ Bottom/Below (下)
Column/Field = column, field

653
00:36:12,720 --> 00:36:16,718
Listening Test

654
00:36:16,718 --> 00:36:21,452
Furigana in katakana?

655
00:36:21,452 --> 00:36:27,918
N1 + は + N2 + ですか = Is N1 N2?
Furigana = furigana (reading in kana)

656
00:36:27,941 --> 00:36:32,335
Listening Test

657
00:36:32,335 --> 00:36:37,573
Yes, in katakana, please.

658
00:36:37,573 --> 00:36:44,687
N + をお願いします = N, please
Katakana = katakana

659
00:36:44,711 --> 00:36:47,144
Listening Test

660
00:36:47,144 --> 00:36:49,877
Got it.

661
00:36:53,734 --> 00:36:57,290
Listening Test

662
00:36:57,290 --> 00:37:01,471
Next is your address.

663
00:37:01,471 --> 00:37:07,205
次は + N = next is N
Address = address

664
00:37:07,228 --> 00:37:10,462
Listening Test

665
00:37:10,462 --> 00:37:14,216
My address is so long.

666
00:37:14,216 --> 00:37:19,359
い-adjective + です = is...
Long (長い) ↔ Short (短い)

667
00:37:19,382 --> 00:37:23,282
Listening Test

668
00:37:23,282 --> 00:37:27,865
You can write it across two lines if you'd like.

669
00:37:27,865 --> 00:37:34,165
Vて + もいい = may do... / can do...
Line (of text) = line
To divide/split = to divide, to split

670
00:37:34,188 --> 00:37:37,904
Listening Test

671
00:37:37,904 --> 00:37:42,281
Should I include my apartment name too?

672
00:37:42,281 --> 00:37:48,315
N + も = also / too
Apartment building/Condominium = apartment building, condominium

673
00:37:48,338 --> 00:37:52,410
Listening Test

674
00:37:52,410 --> 00:37:57,243
Yes, and your room number as well, please.

675
00:37:57,243 --> 00:38:03,824
Vて + ください = please do...
Room = room
Number = number

676
00:38:03,847 --> 00:38:06,747
Listening Test

677
00:38:06,747 --> 00:38:10,082
Okay, I've written it.

678
00:38:10,082 --> 00:38:14,716
Vました = did / have done

679
00:38:14,739 --> 00:38:18,172
Listening Test

680
00:38:18,172 --> 00:38:22,171
Next is your phone number.

681
00:38:22,171 --> 00:38:27,678
次は + N = next is N
Telephone number = telephone number

682
00:38:27,702 --> 00:38:31,888
Listening Test

683
00:38:31,888 --> 00:38:36,856
Is my mobile number okay?

684
00:38:36,856 --> 00:38:43,650
N + でもいいですか = Is N okay?
Mobile phone/Cell phone = mobile phone, cell phone

685
00:38:43,674 --> 00:38:47,662
Listening Test

686
00:38:47,662 --> 00:38:52,395
Yes, that's fine.

687
00:38:52,395 --> 00:38:58,864
大丈夫 = okay, all right

688
00:38:58,887 --> 00:39:02,157
Listening Test

689
