Next is your PIN.

690
00:39:05,991 --> 00:39:11,261
次は + N + ですね = next is N, right?
PIN/Secret code = PIN, secret code

691
00:39:11,285 --> 00:39:15,785
Listening Test

692
00:39:15,785 --> 00:39:21,137
Yes, please choose four numbers.

693
00:39:21,137 --> 00:39:28,437
Vて + ください = please do...
Number/Digit = number, digit
To decide = to decide

694
00:39:28,460 --> 00:39:31,360
Listening Test

695
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:34,719
Can I use my birthday?

696
00:39:34,719 --> 00:39:39,385
N + でもいいですか = Is N okay?
Birthday = birthday

697
00:39:39,408 --> 00:39:42,842
Listening Test

698
00:39:42,842 --> 00:39:46,875
No, birthdays aren't allowed.

699
00:39:46,875 --> 00:39:52,378
N + は + だめです = N is not okay / not allowed
Not allowed = no good, not allowed

700
00:39:52,401 --> 00:39:54,957
Listening Test

701
00:39:54,957 --> 00:39:57,890
Got it.

702
00:40:01,980 --> 00:40:04,772
Listening Test

703
00:40:04,772 --> 00:40:08,005
I'll pick different numbers.

704
00:40:08,005 --> 00:40:12,472
N + に + します = decide on N / choose N
Other/Another = other, another

705
00:40:12,496 --> 00:40:16,370
Listening Test

706
00:40:16,370 --> 00:40:20,945
Please write it carefully so you don't make a mistake.

707
00:40:20,945 --> 00:40:27,223
Vない + ように = so as not to do...
To make a mistake = to make a mistake

708
00:40:27,247 --> 00:40:30,280
Listening Test

709
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:33,814
Okay, I've written it.

710
00:40:33,814 --> 00:40:38,680
Vました = did / have done

711
00:40:38,703 --> 00:40:43,837
Listening Test

712
00:40:43,837 --> 00:40:49,985
Finally, please stamp your seal here.

713
00:40:49,985 --> 00:40:58,351
最後に = at the end / finally
Last (最後) ↔ First (最初)
Personal seal/Stamp = personal seal, stamp

714
00:40:58,374 --> 00:41:00,554
Listening Test

715
00:41:00,554 --> 00:41:03,021
Got it.

716
00:41:06,511 --> 00:41:09,149
Listening Test

717
00:41:09,149 --> 00:41:12,184
Thank you.

718
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,940
Scene 4: Borrowing Pens and Color Rules

719
00:41:17,940 --> 00:41:20,456
Listening Test

720
