Vてください = please do...
To lend (貸す) ↔ To borrow (借りる)

724
00:41:43,277 --> 00:41:46,377
Listening Test

725
00:41:46,377 --> 00:41:50,010
Sure, what seems to be the problem?

726
00:41:50,010 --> 00:41:54,980
どうしましたか = What happened?

727
00:41:55,004 --> 00:41:58,237
Listening Test

728
00:41:58,237 --> 00:42:01,986
My pen isn’t working.

729
00:42:01,986 --> 00:42:07,153
Vません = do not / will not...
To come out / work = come out / work

730
00:42:07,176 --> 00:42:09,309
Listening Test

731
00:42:09,309 --> 00:42:11,695
I see.

732
00:42:15,074 --> 00:42:18,174
Listening Test

733
00:42:18,174 --> 00:42:21,763
Here, you can use this one.

734
00:42:21,763 --> 00:42:26,697
どうぞ = Please / Here you go

735
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:28,830
Listening Test

736
00:42:28,830 --> 00:42:31,209
Thank you.

737
00:42:34,538 --> 00:42:39,172
Listening Test

738
00:42:39,172 --> 00:42:44,672
Please fill out the bank forms using a black pen.

739
00:42:44,672 --> 00:42:52,138
Nで + V = V with / using N
Document = document

740
00:42:52,161 --> 00:42:55,128
Listening Test

741
00:42:55,128 --> 00:42:58,595
Is this pen black?

742
00:42:58,595 --> 00:43:03,339
N + ですか = Is it N?
Black (黒) ↔ White (白)

743
00:43:03,362 --> 00:43:06,629
Listening Test

744
00:43:06,629 --> 00:43:10,462
Yes, it’s black.

745
00:43:10,462 --> 00:43:15,729
黒色 = black color

746
00:43:15,752 --> 00:43:18,706
Listening Test

747
00:43:18,706 --> 00:43:22,139
Would a blue pen be okay?

748
00:43:22,139 --> 00:43:26,885
Nでもいいですか = Is N okay?
Blue = blue

749
00:43:26,909 --> 00:43:29,945
Listening Test

750
00:43:29,945 --> 00:43:33,478
Blue pens are not allowed.

751
00:43:33,478 --> 00:43:38,345
Nはだめです = N is not allowed

752
00:43:38,368 --> 00:43:40,566
Listening Test

753
00:43:40,566 --> 00:43:43,043
Got it.

754
00:43:46,532 --> 00:43:49,666
Listening Test

755
00:43:49,666 --> 00:43:53,332
Please do not use pencils either.

756
00:43:53,332 --> 00:43:58,399
Vないでください = please do not...
Pencil = pencil

757
00:43:58,422 --> 00:44:02,156
Listening Test

758
00:44:02,156 --> 00:44:06,550
Got it, I’ll write with a ballpoint pen.

759
00:44:06,550 --> 00:44:12,588
Nで + V = V with N
To write = write

760
00:44:12,611 --> 00:44:15,955
Listening Test

761
00:44:15,955 --> 00:44:19,856
Erasable pens are also not permitted.

762
00:44:19,856 --> 00:44:25,223
Vことができる = can do...
To erase (消す) ↔ To write (書く)

763
00:44:25,246 --> 00:44:27,280
Listening Test

764
00:44:27,280 --> 00:44:29,547
Got it.

765
00:44:32,803 --> 00:44:36,270
Listening Test

766
00:44:36,270 --> 00:44:40,337
What should I do if I make a mistake?

767
00:44:40,337 --> 00:44:45,918
Vた + とき = when / if V-ed
To make a mistake = make a mistake

768
00:44:45,941 --> 00:44:49,374
Listening Test

769
00:44:49,374 --> 00:44:53,364
Should I rewrite it on a new sheet?

770
00:44:53,364 --> 00:44:58,864
い-adjective + N = [adjective] N
New (新しい) ↔ Old (古い)

771
00:44:58,887 --> 00:45:02,754
Listening Test

772
00:45:02,754 --> 00:45:07,320
No, just draw a double line through it.

773
00:45:07,320 --> 00:45:13,587
Vてください = please do...
Double line = double line

774
00:45:13,610 --> 00:45:16,126
Listening Test

775
00:45:16,126 --> 00:45:18,996
A double line?

776
00:45:18,996 --> 00:45:22,976
Is it N? = N + ですか

777
00:45:22,999 --> 00:45:24,907
Yes, I do.

778
00:45:24,931 --> 00:45:29,313
Listening Test

779
00:45:29,313 --> 00:45:34,507
Then, stamp your seal over it.

780
00:45:34,507 --> 00:45:41,607
そして = and then
Personal seal/Stamp = personal seal / stamp

781
00:45:41,630 --> 00:45:45,130
Listening Test

782
00:45:45,130 --> 00:45:49,237
Is correction tape allowed?

783
00:45:49,237 --> 00:45:54,870
Vてもいいですか = May I do...?
Correction tape = correction tape

784
