Listening Test

785
00:45:58,526 --> 00:46:02,794
Please do not use correction tape.

786
00:46:02,794 --> 00:46:08,661
Vないでください = please do not...
Correction tape = correction tape

787
00:46:08,684 --> 00:46:11,151
Listening Test

788
00:46:11,151 --> 00:46:13,984
Got it.

789
00:46:17,908 --> 00:46:20,141
Listening Test

790
00:46:20,141 --> 00:46:22,618
I’ll be careful.

791
00:46:22,618 --> 00:46:26,118
気をつける = be careful

792
00:46:26,141 --> 00:46:29,608
Listening Test

793
00:46:29,608 --> 00:46:33,647
Please fill out the forms at that desk over there.

794
00:46:33,647 --> 00:46:39,194
Nで + V = V at N
Desk = desk

795
