Yes, I do.

796
00:46:41,314 --> 00:46:44,581
Listening Test

797
00:46:44,581 --> 00:46:48,372
Where should I go after I’m done writing?

798
00:46:48,372 --> 00:46:53,605
Vたら = when / after V-ing
To finish writing = finish writing

799
