Listening Test

800
00:46:56,662 --> 00:47:00,140
Please come back here.

801
00:47:00,140 --> 00:47:04,973
Nへ + 来てください = please come to N
Here (こちら) ↔ There (あちら)

802
00:47:04,996 --> 00:47:07,168
Listening Test

803
00:47:07,168 --> 00:47:09,635
Got it.

804
00:47:13,091 --> 00:47:16,958
Listening Test

805
00:47:16,958 --> 00:47:21,491
If you have any questions, just ask.

806
00:47:21,491 --> 00:47:27,724
Vたら = if / when...
To ask = ask

